  "units": [
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-7:u1",
      "position": 1,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "1️⃣一面 美妙体验\nshoppe一面超nice\n面试官一上来就强调relax\n就当聊天了\n不过虽然面试氛围很好[赞R]\n但能感觉到面试对表达的要求很高\n自我介绍要求不能超过40s[捂脸R]\n而且不能讲简历上有的\n后面的实习八股和场景题\n也都挖的很深\n最后反问面试官评价我\n说感觉都答到了基础还行#\n不过总觉得差一点",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "74062cc63f75b199871551a92e1e7803b06ba352ad160ef1420d06e9132a08f6",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "c2c09a94793206dcd23296c271320ce21620399212a66aaf66cde68abe19500f",
        "source_projection_item_number": 1
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-7:u2",
      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "2️⃣二面 超级压力 秋招最压力的一场\n上来我先自我介绍了三四分钟\n其实之前我也这样介绍\n觉得久的面试官中间会打断我所以我也没改\n看来之后ld面自我介绍要快一点\n结果导致直接被质疑讲太久了\n只能小小🤌道歉一下🙇",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "74062cc63f75b199871551a92e1e7803b06ba352ad160ef1420d06e9132a08f6",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "c2c09a94793206dcd23296c271320ce21620399212a66aaf66cde68abe19500f",
        "source_projection_item_number": 2
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-7:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "然后开始问字节实习部门的业务\n更恐怖了\n说部门的业务听不出来价值在哪\n问我做了啥 我说完之后\n说感觉我也没做啥东西\n（现在复盘 因为部门gap大 介绍的时候不能讲的太抽象 讲业务的时候尽量通俗易懂一点）",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "74062cc63f75b199871551a92e1e7803b06ba352ad160ef1420d06e9132a08f6",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "c2c09a94793206dcd23296c271320ce21620399212a66aaf66cde68abe19500f",
        "source_projection_item_number": 3
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-7:u4",
      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "我赶紧找了个相对复杂的需求找补了一下\n虽然问了一些问题\n不过感觉面试官也没太看上\n可能shopee这边主要是c端\n更关注高并发 技术要求挺高的\n实习全是b端业务 确实比较简单",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "74062cc63f75b199871551a92e1e7803b06ba352ad160ef1420d06e9132a08f6",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "c2c09a94793206dcd23296c271320ce21620399212a66aaf66cde68abe19500f",
        "source_projection_item_number": 4
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-7:u5",
      "position": 5,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "接着是算法题\n给了两题说给我十分钟选一题写\n第一道刚写✍完\n然后让我说第二题算法的思路\n好嘟更汗流浃背了\n还好算法题挺顺利的[皱眉R]",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "74062cc63f75b199871551a92e1e7803b06ba352ad160ef1420d06e9132a08f6",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "c2c09a94793206dcd23296c271320ce21620399212a66aaf66cde68abe19500f",
        "source_projection_item_number": 5
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-7:u6",
      "position": 6,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "最后反问环节\n问了对shopee的了解（还好提前准备过）\n以及手里的offer 面试的进度\n还有base地的期待\n面试官也给了很多后续发展的建议[飞吻R]",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "74062cc63f75b199871551a92e1e7803b06ba352ad160ef1420d06e9132a08f6",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "c2c09a94793206dcd23296c271320ce21620399212a66aaf66cde68abe19500f",
        "source_projection_item_number": 6
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2c7b4000000001b01f8ba:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-7:u7",
      "position": 7,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "虽然压力面很恐怖😱\n不过确实收获更多一点\n比那种顺顺利利面试的成长更大\n希望后面也有多多的ld面",
